# 镜像构建上下文排除项。
# nginx 镜像以仓库根为上下文（docker build -f nginx/Dockerfile .），不排除的话
# 整个仓库都会打进 daemon，既慢又容易把不该进镜像的东西带进去。

offline-images/
offline-wheels/

# Secrets and runtime data must never be sent to BuildKit (including remote
# builders), even when no Dockerfile currently COPYs them.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.dump
**/*.backup
**/*.sql
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/*.log
/logs/

.git/
.github/
.dev-logs/
.claude/

**/node_modules/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.venv/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# 本地产物：镜像里由 npm run build 重新生成，带进去只会造成"改了没生效"的错觉
frontend/dist/

.DS_Store
